{
  "category": "Wild Duck Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "The sprig of green onions it holds is its weapon. It is used much like a metal sword.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "The sprig of green onions it holds is its weapon. It is used much like a metal sword.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lives where reedy plants grow. They are rarely seen, so it's thought their numbers are decreasing.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "If anyone tries to disturb where the essential plant sticks grow, it uses its own stick to thwart them.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "If it eats the plant stick it carries as emer gency rations, it runs off in search of a new stick.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "In order to prevent their extinction, more people have made an effort to breed these POKéMON.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "FARFETCH’D is always seen with a stick from a plant of some sort. Apparently, there are good sticks and bad sticks. This POKéMON has been known to fight with others over sticks.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "FARFETCH’D is always seen with a stick from a plant of some sort. Apparently, there are good sticks and bad sticks. This POKéMON has been known to fight with others over sticks.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is always seen with a stick from a plant. Apparently, there are good sticks and bad sticks. This POKéMON occasionally fights with others over choice sticks.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It always walks about with a plant stalk clamped in its beak. The stalk is used for building its nest.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "The plant stalk it holds is its weapon. The stalk is used like a sword to cut all sorts of things.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life.",
      "version": "pearl"
