    {
      "text": "Farfetch’d is always seen with a stalk from a plant of some sort. Apparently, there are good stalks and bad stalks. This Pokémon has been known to fight with others over stalks.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Farfetch’d is always seen with a stalk from a plant of some sort. Apparently, there are good stalks and bad stalks. This Pokémon has been known to fight with others over stalks.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "They live where reedy plants grow. Farfetch’d are rarely seen, so it’s thought their numbers are decreasing.",
      "version": "lets-go-pikachu"
    },
    {
      "text": "They live where reedy plants grow. Farfetch’d are rarely seen, so it’s thought their numbers are decreasing.",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    },
    {
      "text": "The stalk this Pokémon carries in its wings serves as a sword to cut down opponents. In a dire situation, the stalk can also serve as food.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "They use a plant stalk as a weapon, but not all of them use it in the same way. Several distinct styles of stalk fighting have been observed.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
